			<div class="content" id="post-content-1419467">
									

<p>The sentences, &quot;The device was recovered by SCP personnel following reports of unusual behavior among students at ████ High School in ████, PA. School officials began an investigation when teachers reported that a number of students were behaving unusually.&quot; seem redundant. One or the other should be eliminated in my opinion</p>
<p>Anyways, I like this one a lot. Glad to see thought was put into how mental capacity would diminish below a certain size. I do wonder exactly how small a brain could be in real life before it would be impossible for the one with said brain to have human intelligence, however. If anybody finds the exact size (or at least roughly that size), can they edit your article to have the appropriate scale?</p>

